27:56.279 --> 27:58.880
Kita nak ambil peperiksaan universiti sama-sama!

27:59.319 --> 28:02.279
Kita nak ambil peperiksaan universiti sama-sama!

28:04.079 --> 28:07.039
Kita nak ambil peperiksaan universiti sama-sama!

